post-it: Blue screen of death
symptoms:
	Blue screen at startup
		category: At startup
	Hard drive clicks
checks:
	Windows stays up after the desktop appears
		shows: a moment after the desktop appears, it stops and reboots
	Runs without a bluescreen
		shows: 2 s after the desktop appears, a bluescreen says "A fatal exception 0E has occurred", in silence, and 6 s later it reboots
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Remove the hard drive, throw it in the trash
	Get a new hard drive from storage
	Install the hard drive
	Remount the shell
